{
  "info": {
    "name": "pruebaPeriferiaFinal",
    "description": "Colección Postman completa — periferia-backend (Spring Boot 3.4.2, Java 17). Generada leyendo directamente AuthController, TestController, UsuarioController, PerfilController, CategoriaController, PublicacionController, SecurityConfig y las entidades JPA. Rutas públicas (SecurityConfig): /api/auth/** y /test/**. Todo lo demás requiere JWT (Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}). baseUrl apunta por defecto al backend directo (levantado con docker compose o con ./mvnw spring-boot:run). Si se prueba la solución completa dockerizada a través del proxy de Nginx del frontend, cambiar baseUrl por el valor de baseUrlDocker (http://localhost:8090/api/v1) — Nginx reenvía /api/v1/ al backend igual.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:8080/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "baseUrlDocker",
      "value": "http://localhost:8090/api/v1"
    },
    {
      "key": "username",
      "value": "daniel"
    },
    {
      "key": "password",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "accessToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "refreshToken",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "usuarioId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "perfilId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "categoriaId",
      "value": "1"
    },
    {
      "key": "publicacionId",
      "value": "1"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "AuthController — @RequestMapping(\"/api/auth\"). Rutas públicas (SecurityConfig: /api/auth/** permitAll).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{username}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{password}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "POST /api/auth/login. Body: LoginRequestDto {username, password}. Autentica contra AuthenticationManager (BCrypt) y devuelve TokenResponseDto {accessToken, refreshToken, tokenType, expiresIn=600}. El test script guarda accessToken/refreshToken como variables de colección."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Me (validar token actual)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "me"
              ]
            },
            "description": "GET /api/auth/me. Ruta bajo /api/auth/** (permitAll a nivel de SecurityConfig), pero el propio controller exige @AuthenticationPrincipal no nulo: sin Bearer token válido responde 401. Con token válido devuelve id, username, activo, tipoDocumento, numeroDocumento del usuario dueño del token."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.accessToken);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', json.refreshToken);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "refresh"
              ]
            },
            "description": "POST /api/auth/refresh. Body: {refreshToken}. Busca usuario por refresh_token, valida activo/eliminado/expiración, y rota ambos tokens (usuarioService.actualizarTokens). Devuelve TokenResponseDto nuevo."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh2 (legacy)",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refreshToken\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh2",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "auth",
                "refresh2"
              ]
            },
            "description": "POST /api/auth/refresh2. Ruta alterna legacy que usa el campo 'token' (no 'refresh_token') vía usuarioService.findByToken. Mantenida por compatibilidad — preferir /api/auth/refresh."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Test",
      "description": "TestController — @RequestMapping(\"/test\"). Pública (SecurityConfig: /test/** permitAll).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Status",
          "request": {
            "auth": {
              "type": "noauth"
            },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/test/status",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "test",
                "status"
              ]
            },
            "description": "GET /test/status. Sin autenticación. Devuelve {estado, mensaje} — útil para healthcheck manual."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Usuarios",
      "description": "UsuarioController — @RequestMapping(\"/api/usuarios\"). Requiere JWT (anyRequest().authenticated()).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "usuarios"
              ]
            },
            "description": "GET /api/usuarios. Devuelve List<Usuario> con password oculto (ocultarPassword)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener por id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/{{usuarioId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "usuarios",
                "{{usuarioId}}"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Crear",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"nuevo.usuario\",\n  \"password\": \"secreto123\",\n  \"tipoDocumento\": \"CC\",\n  \"numeroDocumento\": \"123456789\",\n  \"activo\": true\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "usuarios"
              ]
            },
            "description": "POST /api/usuarios. Body: entidad Usuario (username, password, tipoDocumento, numeroDocumento, activo opcional). El controller fuerza id=null, hashea password con BCrypt, y defaultea activo=true / eliminado=1 si vienen nulos."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Editar",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tipoDocumento\": \"CC\",\n  \"numeroDocumento\": \"987654321\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/{{usuarioId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "usuarios",
                "{{usuarioId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "PUT /api/usuarios/{id}. Update parcial: solo los campos no nulos en el body se aplican (username, tipoDocumento, numeroDocumento, activo, eliminado, password — password solo se re-hashea si viene no vacío)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Eliminar",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/{{usuarioId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "usuarios",
                "{{usuarioId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "DELETE /api/usuarios/{id}. Nota: la tabla usuario tiene trigger de soft-delete (trg_soft_delete_usuario) — el DELETE físico de Postgres queda interceptado y en su lugar marca eliminado=0."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
